SUMMARY:Oh\, Mary!
LOCATION:Trafalgar Theatre\, 14 Whitehall\, London
DESCRIPTION:Comedy legend Cole Escola’s dark\, off-beat\, and utterly out
 rageous historical comedy comes to the UK. This gleefully anachronistic tak
 e on American history follows Mary Todd Lincoln\, wife to Abraham Lincoln: 
 a woman who's feisty\, thorny\, drunken\, and utterly unforgettable. Don’
 t miss this short and snappy 80-minute play packed with gags and mayhem\, i
 n a wild story about a First Lady as you’ve never seen her before.\nMore 
 info: https://comedyatlas.app/comedy-atlas/event/oh-mary-92609/
